    "result_text": "The full test suite is green. `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class (the other two files are the base/helper). \n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipNumber` assignment, formatted `<customerCode>-M<YY>` (YY = last two digits of the `registrationDate` year, e.g. `SMI-0007-M26`), following the existing OfficeFloor function-per-step pattern used for `customerCode`.\n\nChanges:\n1. **`model/Owner.java`** \u2014 added the persisted `membershipNumber` field (`@Column(name = \"membership_number\")`) with getter/setter.\n2. **`rest/function/owner/AssignMembershipNumber.java`** (new) \u2014 computes `String.format(\"%s-M%02d\", customerCode, registrationDate.getYear() % 100)` and sets it on the owner. Modeled on `AssignCustomerCode`.\n3. **`officefloor/rest/api/owners.POST.yml`** \u2014 inserted an `assignMembershipNumber` step (with `govern: [ transaction ]`) between `assignCustomerCode` and `countNamesakes`, so it runs after both the customer code is assigned and the registration date is defaulted.\n4. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the read-only `membershipNumber` property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gets the field and MapStruct auto-maps it by name into both POST and GET responses.\n5. **`db/{hsqldb,h2,mysql,postgres}/schema.sql`** \u2014 added the `membership_number` column.\n6. **`db/hsqldb/data.sql`** \u2014 added a trailing `NULL` to the 10 positional owner seed inserts to match the new column (h2/postgres use explicit column lists and were unaffected).\n\n`./mvnw test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
